item.description:
[NEW] &lt;p&gt;The enhanced screen recording capability offers greater flexibility and control, enabling organizations to manage recording behavior with more precision. Key enhancements include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access all recording settings and configurations from &lt;strong&gt;Customer Service admin center&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;gt (GA: April CY2027) — Dynamics 365 Customer Service

[NEW] &lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define outreach scenario/goal in natural language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Choose desired call-to-action to drive next steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide subject line guidance: fixed suggestion or style recommendation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set message length and brevity targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Specify tone rules, including name-usage (GA: July CY2026) — Microsoft Copilot (Microsoft 365), Dynamics 365 Sales

[NEW] &lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Segment-specific qualification&lt;/strong&gt;: Each agent operates with its own ideal customer profile, knowledge sources, templates, and consent settings, ensuring qualification conversations reflect the nuances of each product, region, or team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Intelligent lead routing&lt; (GA: September CY2026) — Microsoft Copilot (Microsoft 365), Dynamics 365 Sales

[NEW] &lt;p&gt;The enhanced screen recording capability offers greater flexibility and control, enabling organizations to manage recording behavior with more precision. Key enhancements include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access all recording settings and configurations from &lt;strong&gt;Customer Service admin center&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;gt (GA: July CY2026) — Dynamics 365 Customer Service

[NEW] &lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customize your view: choose a Contact or Lead view from the new view picker to define which columns appear in the segment members table.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align export with your view: exported member data automatically reflects your selected columns, ensuring consistency and eliminating post-export  (GA: June CY2026) — Dynamics 365 Customer Insights - Journeys

&lt;p&gt;Currently, to bring tasks from another project into a new project, you must manually enter the task details in the task grid or use schedule APIs. You can also use the &lt;strong&gt;Copy project&lt;/strong&gt; feature to create a new project with the same tasks, but this feature has limitations:&lt;br&gt;
​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;u (GA: October CY2026) — Dynamics 365 Project Operations
